SUMMARY:Deadline 23:59 GMT: Swarovski Foundation: Creatives for Our Future 
 2026/27 (Global Grant for Emerging Creatives)
DESCRIPTION:Closes 09 Nov 2026 at 23:59 GMT.\n\nCreatives for Our Future is
  the Swarovski Foundation's global grant programme for emerging creatives 
 aged 21 to 30. Each selected participant receives a EUR 20\,000 grant to s
 upport their creative project\, alongside a mentorship and education progr
 amme.\n\nOrganisation: Swarovski Foundation\nLocation: Worldwide. Open to 
 creatives aged 21 to 30 at the time of application.\nAward: EUR 20\,000 gr
 ant per selected participant\, plus a mentorship and education programme. 
 No application fee.\nDuration: Grant plus accompanying mentorship programm
 e.\n\nMore: https://creatives.swarovskifoundation.org/?utm_source=artifici
 alnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://creatives.swarovskifoundation.org/?utm_source=artificialnouveau
 grantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Worldwide. Open to creatives aged 21 to 30 at the time of applicat
 ion.
END:VEVENT
