 y VIA's three core values of Artistic Production\, Thought Leadership\, an
 d Public Engagement.\n\nOrganisation: VIA Art Fund\nLocation: Worldwide (p
 rojects exhibited beyond museum walls\, in the public realm\, or in non-tr
 aditional exhibition environments)\nAward: $25\,000 to $100\,000 per proje
 ct\nDuration: Per project (must start after 15 June 2027)\n\nMore: https:/
 /viaartfund.org/apply/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=re
 ferral
