SUMMARY:Deadline: Palestine Film Fund (Autumn 2026 cycle): up to EUR 15\,00
 0 for Palestinian filmmakers
DESCRIPTION:The Palestine Film Fund\, set up by the Palestine Film Institut
 e in 2025 so that Palestinians can tell their own stories\, gives financia
 l and professional support to Palestinian filmmakers worldwide in two roun
 ds a year. This is the autumn round.\n\nOrganisation: Palestine Film Insti
 tute\nLocation: For Palestinian directors living in Palestine or the diasp
 ora\; projects can be made anywhere. Applications in English or Arabic.\nA
 ward: Short films (up to 30 min): up to EUR 3\,000 for development or EUR 
 7\,000 for production or post-production. Medium and feature films: up to 
 EUR 5\,000 for development or EUR 15\,000 for post-production (production 
 stage not eligible). No application fee.\nDuration: Per project\; decision
 s 10 to 12 weeks after the deadline.\n\nMore: https://www.palestinefilmins
 titute.org/en/palestine-film-fund?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&ut
 m_medium=referral
URL:https://www.palestinefilminstitute.org/en/palestine-film-fund?utm_sourc
 e=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:For Palestinian directors living in Palestine or the diaspora\; pr
 ojects can be made anywhere. Applications in English or Arabic.
END:VEVENT
