SUMMARY:Deadline: Social Web Foundation: Fediverse Multimedia Grants (up to
  USD 20\,000 for developer/creator teams)
DESCRIPTION:The Social Web Foundation's Fediverse Multimedia Grants\, funde
 d by the Interledger Foundation\, pair software developers with creators a
 nd publishers to bring new rich content (audio\, video and images) to the 
 Fediverse. Teams start a new publication on the Fediverse while improving 
 ActivityPub-enabled software for creators' needs: authoring\, editing\, or
 ganising and publishing multimedia content.\n\nOrganisation: Social Web Fo
 undation\, funded by the Interledger Foundation\nLocation: Online applicat
 ion\; no geographic restriction stated.\nAward: Grants of up to USD 20\,00
 0 per developer/creator team. No application fee stated.\nDuration: Projec
 ts start 1 December 2026.\n\nMore: https://socialwebfoundation.org/2026/10
 /07/call-for-proposals-fediverse-multimedia-grants/?utm_source=artificialn
 ouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://socialwebfoundation.org/2026/10/07/call-for-proposals-fediverse
 -multimedia-grants/?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=refer
 ral
LOCATION:Online application\; no geographic restriction stated.
END:VEVENT
